  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek Prensi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin
    De\u011Ferli {{isim}}.\n\nHayat yolculu\u011Funda baz\u0131 aksakl\u0131klarla
    kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Fm\u0131\u015F, hayallerine seni ula\u015Ft\u0131racak
    aktarmal\u0131 seyahatlerindeki birka\xE7 otob\xFCs\xFC ka\xE7\u0131rm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    K\xFC\xE7\xFCk detaylara \xE7ok fazla tak\u0131lan m\xFCkemmeliyet\xE7i bir yap\u0131ya
    sahipmi\u015Fsin; belki ge\xE7mi\u015Fte, \u015Fimdi oldu\u011Fundan da fazla.
    En ufak badireler bile senin t\xFCm oda\u011F\u0131n\u0131 kaplam\u0131\u015F
    ve ilerlemen aksam\u0131\u015F. Ka\xE7\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131n f\u0131rsatlar
    y\xFCz\xFCnden zaman zaman se\xE7eneklerin azalm\u0131\u015F ve kapana k\u0131s\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
    gibi hissetmi\u015Fsin. Senin i\xE7in hem maddi hem de manevi anlamda \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk
    \xE7ok \xF6nemliymi\u015F. Onu zamanla kaybetmekte oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmek,
    umutlar\u0131na hepten balta vurmu\u015F."
